ndecodable(recordCount:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/DropReport\/undecodable(recordCount:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recovery read "},{"code":"recordCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" intact records it couldn’t decode: their event type isn’t in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the store’s "},{"code":"events","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or its "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/BinaryCodable\/init(from:)"},{"type":"text","text":" threw, as it does for a record"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written before a required property was added or a property’s type changed while the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event’s "},{"code":"Event.schemaVersion","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" stayed the same."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"undecodable","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"recordCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/dropreport\/undecodable(recordcount:)","type":"topic","title":"DropReport.undecodable(recordCount:)"},"doc://Persistence/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://Persistence/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/s8SendableP"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/DropReport":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/DropReport","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a store dropped before they were delivered, and why."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind